        {
          "title": "可玩的封面",
          "content": "<p>红牛公司推出了一本纸质的游戏杂志《GamePop》。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032002.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它的封面有一个可以玩的“俄罗斯方块”，是世界首本封面可以玩游戏的书。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032003.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032004.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>奥秘就是封面里面，嵌入了一块非常薄的柔性电路板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032005.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这块板配备了180个 RGB LED 灯、7个电容式触摸按钮、一颗32位 ARM 芯片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032006.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它还包含一块可充电电池，可以通过 Type-C 充电。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032007.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>可惜的是，这个封面是限量版，不公开出售。它得到了俄罗斯方块公司的官方授权，全球仅发行150套，每套均有独立编号。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "可玩的封面",
              "url": "https://www.yankodesign.com/2026/03/16/red-bull-just-put-a-playable-tetris-game-on-a-magazine-cover/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032002.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032003.webp",
