          "title": "*",
          "content": "<p><em>微信的龙虾接口</em>*</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032301.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>微信官方本周发布了龙虾接口，AI 机器人可以向微信发消息了。</p>\n<p>很多项目利用这个接口做二次开发，便于各种 Bot 和 Agent 网关的接入。</p>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://github.com/tianrking/weixin-agent-rs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wechat-rs-sdk</a>（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/9343\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tianrking</a> 投稿）<br />- <a href=\"https://github.com/corespeed-io/wechatbot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WeChatBot</a>（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/9369\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@jiweiyuan</a> 投稿）<br />- <a href=\"https://github.com/fastclaw-ai/weclaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WeClaw</a>（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/9347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@idoubi</a> 投稿）<br />- <a href=\"https://github.com/nanbingxyz/wechat-channel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WeChat-Channel</a>（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/9357\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@nanbingxyz</a> 投稿）</p>",
