        {
          "title": "苹果壁纸彩蛋",
          "content": "<p>苹果公司最近发布了新笔记本 MacBook Neo，跟以前一样，配一张特别的壁纸。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032502.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>壁纸里面嵌入了产品名，以前的壁纸也有这个彩蛋。</p>\n<p>iMac</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032503.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>MacBook Pro</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032504.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>iPad Air</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032505.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>MacBook Air</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032507.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>iPad Mini</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032506.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>iPad Pro</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202603/bg2026032508.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
